  "projectUrl": "https://www.questpdf.com/",
  "published": "2026-09-25T15:17:53.783Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Updated Skia to m154.\n- Updated qpdf to 12.4.1.\n- Fixed an issue where garbage collection could corrupt PDF tag attributes during concurrent PDF generation.\n- Improved PDF/UA-1 compatibility when generating ZUGFeRD and Factur-X invoices.\n- Fixed an issue in the `DocumentOperation` API where `DocumentAttachmentRelationship.Supplement` was incorrectly mapped to `/Alternative`.\n- Improved handling of stream-writing exceptions during PDF generation.\n- The ShowInCompanion API now automatically starts the Companion App if it is not already running (requires Companion App 2026.9.0 or newer).\n- Improved exception messages related to `Settings.ThrowOnMissingFontFamilies`, `Settings.ThrowOnMissingTextGlyphs`, and `Settings.UseSystemFonts`.\n- Reduced connection time to the Companion App on Windows.\n- Added missing license files for dependencies.",
